# --- Compiled object / binary artifacts ---
*.o
*.obj
*.ko
*.cubin
*.a
*.lib
*.la
*.lo
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.app

# Built executables. Convention: every compiled binary ends in .out
# (Linux executables have no extension by default, so we impose one here).
# See AGENTS.md. Makefile targets use BIN = <name>.out
*.out

